{
  "label": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
  "category": "Tutorials",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
      "id": "tutorial-first-rule",
      "intro": "Buat rule deteksi fraud pertama Anda dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah di bawah ini. Kita akan membuat rule GENERAL sederhana: deteksi transfer di atas Rp50.000.000 ke luar negeri.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Halaman Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik menu **Scenario Studio** di sidebar kiri\n• Lihat daftar rule yang sudah ada (mungkin kosong)\n• Klik **+ Tambah Scenario** di pojok kanan atas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#eff6ff;border-bottom:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a\">Scenario Studio</div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:7px;color:#fff;font-weight:600\">+ Tambah Scenario</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pilih Tipe Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **GENERAL** — 3 langkah, untuk rule sederhana\n• **CONDITION** — 4 langkah, untuk rule kompleks\n• Pilih GENERAL dulu untuk belajar",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;display:flex;gap:6px\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center\">GENERAL</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center\">3 langkah<br/>Sederhana</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;opacity:.6\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center\">CONDITION</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center\">4 langkah<br/>Kompleks</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Isi Parameter Rule (Step 1)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Rule Name** — Nama rule (contoh: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri)\n• **Risk Score** — Nilai 0-100, makin tinggi makin berbahaya\n• **Priority** — HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n• **Active Period** — Jadwal aktif rule (misal: 24/7)",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a\">Rule Name</span><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:6px;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #bbf7d0\">✓</span></div><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;font-size:7px;color:#0f172a\">Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:6px;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #bbf7d0\">Risk: 75</span><span style=\"padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:6px;color:#dc2626;border:1px solid #fecaca\">Priority: HIGH</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Bangun Detection Flow (Step 2)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **CONSTANT** — Field: amount, Operator: >, Value: 50000000\n• **CONTAINS** — Field: destination, Operator: EQUALS, Value: FOREIGN\n• **LOGICAL AND** — Gabungkan kedua kondisi\n• **ALERT** — Hasil akhir kirim alert\n• Hubungkan: Start → CONSTANT → AND → ALERT dan Start → CONTAINS → AND",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#f1f5f9);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\"><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b\">AMOUNT > 50JT</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981\">IS FOREIGN</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1\">AND</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Review & Submit (Step 3)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Lihat ringkasan rule (nama, risk score, priority, flow diagram)\n• Periksa node dan konfigurasi yang sudah dibuat\n• Klik **Submit** untuk menyimpan rule sebagai Draft",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#f5f3ff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a\">📋 Review Summary</div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-size:7px;color:#475569\"><div>Rule: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri</div><div>Risk: 75 | Priority: HIGH</div><div>Nodes: 4 — 1 Start, 2 Conditions, 1 Alert</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
